{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10121140","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10121140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1012114001:0":{"text":"ごめんなさい、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さん……私、知らない人と話すのが苦手で……様子がおかしい人だと、なおさら……","source_cn":"抱歉，<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EDEFE835F742CAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012114002:1":{"text":"みんな、まるで金麦村のブドウを食べた村人みたいに、話が支離滅裂だったよ。","source_cn":"他们就像金穗村那些吃了葡萄的村民，说着没有逻辑的话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAEC2B96E5E87483","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012114003:1":{"text":"数少ない正常な人にはほぼ話を聞いたけど、誰もアルドンじいちゃんの行き先を知らないみたい。","source_cn":"为数不多的那几个正常人，我都挨个打听了，没人知道雅顿老...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF066BFEDB29B2895","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012114004:1":{"text":"唯一分かったのは半年前にこの村に一度来たことだけ。あまり有用な情報とは言えないね。","source_cn":"只知道他半年前来过一次塔兰村，这个消息好像对我们没什么帮助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC299510AEF97E679","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012114005:0":{"text":"少し妙なことがあるの。\nこの雨……今降っている雨よ。","source_cn":"我发现了一些异样。\\n雨……这场雨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x452EA87168EC37AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012114006:0":{"text":"あっ、そういえば、村に入ってからずっと雨が降ってるね……今はバドーゾ山脈の雨季なのかな？","source_cn":"啊，说起来，我们进了村子后一直在下雨……现在是瓦度索山...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BB2C221540A0B68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012114007:1":{"text":"妙なのは、この雨が暖かいってことよ。","source_cn":"问题在于，<style=highlight>这场雨很温...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAEC6337E738B081","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1012114008:0":{"text":"暖かいのがおかしいの？","source_cn":"温暖有什么奇怪的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCB3E4FAECD733A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012114009:1":{"text":"ここは山脈地帯だ。通常なら雨水の温度は低いはず……だからこれは普通の雨ではなく、誰かが<style=\"highlight\">魔法で降らせている</style>ことになる。","source_cn":"这里是山脉地带，按理说，雨水的温度应该比较低。所以，这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB21EB62CE3BF3E89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012114010:0":{"text":"そういうこと……敵じゃないといいんだけど。そういえば、ブライアンはどこ？","source_cn":"没错……但愿对方不是敌人。话说回来，有谁看到布莱恩了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDFD9FC6E53E55EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1012114011:0":{"text":"あっちだ。こっちに向かって手を振ってるな。見に行ってみよう。","source_cn":"他在那边，正在向我们招手。过去看看吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E04E5D886B37187","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"ライカ","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"クイン","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"エルロン","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":3}}